{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_st_08-04","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"st_08-04","title":"意志，片缕幻影","storyCode":"M8-4","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-04.txt","sourceHash":"0ac1b12cff0308b6fb4ba6a4f55b10295e09629cee4a750a9d876c5f53a6c5a4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"现在线4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说的这些......什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"“罗德岛，我邀请你们一同战斗。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我只会说乌萨斯语，你也是用乌萨斯语问我的。你应该听懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们比我们更熟悉切尔诺伯格这些工业机器吧？你们受到的这方面的训练肯定比我们多。我们更会打仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们也要去指挥塔，那你们肯定也安排好了去关掉这玩意的人。不能让它封闭道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队必须分兵。如果游击队不把四分之三的力量分出去保护其他地方的感染者，那他们会被杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉手下的整合运动已经陷入疯癫，发生在切尔诺伯格的报复事件已经够多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然剩下四分之一的游击队已经能够打掉塔露拉那些蠢笨的卫队，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这时候，多一个帮手，就能多抢占一些胜机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"源石祭坛已经失效。我们的魔族佬也不错，但大尉那种精怪传说里一般的神力，他们还是做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要更多火力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能点头同意，或是摇头否定？你们的领袖就是那只卡特斯吗？还是那只菲林？你们同样有力，都能承担大任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"问阿米娅。我只是罗德岛的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你同意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，如果你所代表的整合运动，依然是个以主张救助感染者为第一优先目标的组织，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而不是代表着乌萨斯某种国家政治力量的感染者团体......我们于公于私都会同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动与我们之间的矛盾和既有暴力事件的创伤，在这一时半刻是无法抹平的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以摆出一副愿意原谅罪行或者乞求宽恕的态度，但那是对真正受害者的不尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你们整合运动杀害了我的朋友。我们刚刚杀死了你们尊敬的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻哼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我能明白......我杀了你们的家人，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"这不可能原谅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们是感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我方有感染者不同意你们的加入，那就是违抗命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的命令，是摧毁塔露拉和她麾下的恶棍。违抗命令的，都会被处决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你想放下？你能......放下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你杀了我们的亲人。你杀了我们的指挥官，我们的领袖和榜样，我们的大尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们不会因为你这么做了就动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不想报仇吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"当然想。别逼我一遍又一遍地解释，菲林！听我说完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在更高尚的目标之前，我们个人的仇恨不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"有更值得我们去恨的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"恨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，你知道的吧？你身边这只卡特斯，就像大尉说的那样，还是个充满幻想的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不准这么说阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你相信她那套教化别人的傲慢想法，那就照她说的去做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你会被人背叛，到死也不自知，你也救不了身边的人。看起来高尚，实际上不管用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们，我们相信大尉，他一路走来，向我们展示了一条不同以往乌萨斯无数争斗的道路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"一条高尚的复仇与毁灭之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毁灭之路？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"毁灭敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"认清你的敌人，然后毁灭他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是，谁是敌人？散播恨意，一味施暴，引起的战争，被卷入的悲剧，这难道好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这没让你们失去自己的朋友和战友吗？乌萨斯不也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"先皇许诺过，总有一天这场战争会结束！而我们也笃信他伟大的愿景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你做的那些才让我看不到头。讲道理？他们不讲道理。有的人就是混账，有的恶棍就是该杀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，听着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"斩杀仇敌不会让你痛快，原因很简单，因为这事儿还没完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"要做就做到底，要杀就杀干净，把这个国家里的龌龊事情一扫而空，看着白茫茫一片的雪原......这时候你才会高兴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"想想吧，我们去把他们杀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"把那个指挥塔上害死我们多少同胞的阴谋家杀了，把各个城市作威作福的统治者杀了，把各个军团的废物和叛徒全都杀了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"最后再把现在皇帝身边那些用花言巧语祸害乌萨斯的群臣，全都杀了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"回头看看，再回头看看！你会看到那些该活着的人都活下来了，他们安居乐业，再也不用为谁送命为谁挨饿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是在这样做的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"谁害死你的朋友，你就杀掉谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想直接杀死塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？不杀她，大尉能安息吗？我们对得起叶莲娜小姐和她的雪怪吗，我们无数的整合运动兄弟们就这么被她怂恿着送了命吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"等一个圣人，等一个好皇帝，等一个英雄......我们厌倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"等到了又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"伟大的皇帝陨落了，他最宝贵的遗产无人继承，所有人都在为了那些微不足道的利益勾心斗角，撕裂这个国家，挤压他的人民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"圣人被活埋了，英雄刚才就已经死在我们面前了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这哪里是你们能理解的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们有能理解的。菲林，你失去过亲人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神已经把答案告诉我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和你说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但你会听的，菲林。你有着战士的眼神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"封闭层还在上升......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西没见停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"要调谐源石传动需要不少时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们最好快点。这门如果阖上，那乌萨斯公义的大门，可能是又要等上有几百年才能再开启了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队不只是在为了感染者而战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不只是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者只是个理由。想要的话，多少都有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走上雪原只有一个原因，那就是乌萨斯破坏了公平和秩序。大尉说了，感染者原本不必这样子，这只是现在乌萨斯的手段！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"想象一下，一场大远征......大尉带我们走到这里，怎么会只是为了感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们从边疆来到边疆，绕过坚固的要塞城市，夺下帝国命脉的控制权，联合各种力量，长驱直入，刺向腐朽帝国的心脏......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你难道没想过吗？你可不只是因为变成感染者才变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们公平地对待所有人，你可能不用变成感染者的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"想想看，那些端坐城市的市民和贵族，商人和唱歌跳舞的，有几个人感染了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"而在荒原上，在城市周围和矿场里，又有多少人感染了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这个仇，必须得报！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"向谁报复？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"所有挡在这条正道前面的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不恨那些把我们变成这样的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在说感染者遭遇的不公这件事！我是说，将这变成一种宣泄的手段，这很......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他们为了自己，让我们变成这样......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那些把我们变成怪物的人！我......我也恨他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"对不对，菲林？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......对不起。\n这会很痛。\n对不起......阿米娅。这不该发生在你身上的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你......阿米娅，你为什么......为什么会这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"难道他们不可恨吗？难道他们没有抢走你的生活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想忘记那些事情......我不想忘记我的朋友和家人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本可以穿自己喜欢的衣服，去自己想去的学校，我想知道我的爸爸妈妈是什么样，我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......兄弟......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，别急......别急！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅说的这些，只有这些......我不管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我受伤就能让他们不受伤，要是我受苦可以让他们不受苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那就，那就让我来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"要是杀了他们，杀了那些毁掉我们生活的人能让你们都更好受一些的话，阿米娅，你不愿意做的话，就让我来吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，阿米娅，来自工程小队的通讯......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们受到了奇怪的干扰，传动结构卡住不动了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......敌人？队长听到请回话，这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不对！他们是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长！当心乌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退开！跳下去，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？快回话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......快回话呀！拉瓦卡！碧银！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不不不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"封闭层还在上升！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（工程小组......遇伏了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不对，碧银，碧银她，我摸不到她了，我够不着她了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......准备爆炸物。把这里全部炸掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"炸毁摧毁封闭层意味着这附近的数条街道也不能幸免，还有躲藏着的不合作感染者在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"没有时间了。再磨蹭下去只会死更多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯彻底断线了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不同意就拿出更好的方案来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不行。\n绝对不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说的我都......我不知道。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我的小队......我的小队成员......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经做得很好了，他们为什么会遇到这种事！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"要是需要力气，需要摧毁什么的话，我来不就好了吗！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！蜷起手指！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要......撕开......毁掉不就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什......封闭层被强行停住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不就好了！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸？！不，不，那个菲林，她......那是用什么东西撕扯了地块？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么......什么东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"简直，简直是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"你们第一次见霜星与塔露拉，难道不也是这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"等你我身上的感染症状再严重点......说不定还会见到更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......我......有些冷......头好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！我抓住你了，我抓住你了......别松开，你也要抓紧......抓紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"她一个人摧毁了封闭层？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然支撑不了多久......但应该够我们通过整片区域了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗干员！快来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃呃......呜......！在抓我，在抓我，在抓我......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"负面情感和直接作用性法术导致的副作用......全是和碧银相关的记忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......看我这里，看我的眼睛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（黑色的线条从魔王的手指流进了菲林的眼睛......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的确是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，呜......我知道......知道的......阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以再这么做......！但，但就算我这样说了你也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......对，对不起......我不会改的。嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好，菲林。做得非常好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟们，我们向前走！顶着炮火和弩箭，我们前进！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就现在这里歇一会儿吧，罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"能暂且等一下吗，游击队的战士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们相互之间没有通讯方式。即使是你身边那位前罗德岛雇员，他的通讯设备也没有我们这一次行动的权限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果盾卫真的需要我们配合......那么至少应该了解一下罗德岛会怎样去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"好。等上一会儿也无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这只小菲林帮了我们大忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"（微弱地喘气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会有事的。我还要......继续......战斗呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"得......去......找我的工程小组。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"又是，陈长官的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是一定会回去咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"可你也说了，现在你这个朋友在乌萨斯生死不明，你回去龙门也没什么用吧。唔，毕业以后直接去乌萨斯......可能不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯是不会开入境准证给我这种人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧......唉，但真的好可惜，你居然读完就走。陈陈头脑那么好，进修个高级讲师不成问题的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"过两年资历就唰唰地上去了呀，这在哪个国家都会很吃香吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别再那么叫我了，求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我头脑怎么样你也知道。不笨是肯定的，但是你说聪明吧......我联合作战课每次都只是刚及格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"刚考完的那门军事战略？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"每次都差点没及格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你已经比维多利亚百分之九十八的人都有头脑了。至少纸面上是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"但讲师我肯定是不指望啦。再说，比起一上来就去搞指挥搞技术的军官，我还是觉得，得从士兵一步步做起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是不怕死。谁知道维多利亚的士兵会在战场上遇到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"可敌人也不想在战场上遇到维多利亚的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怕在战略地图前面坐太久，会慢慢把人命看成数字。很可怕。前线和各个驻地的士兵需要有人去告诉他们什么该做，什么不该做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"只有亲身上了战场，才会知道战斗有多残忍，战争有多不该发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真想改变维多利亚？我以为......以为那是你酒后瞎说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"没，没啊。有那么奇怪吗？！我就......就只是想做点好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好事不易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那我回龙门也是差不多的原因。我不想龙门再发生更多坏事。呆在龙门，解决坏事，阻止坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是要回去当警察？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"警察？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"哇。我一直觉得陈陈你看上去就是那种，会狠狠地揍歹徒一顿的人。我没看错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别下结论。但警察......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"警察也不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"警察应该也会手握更多线索吧，当年的事，现在的事......不用再靠我那个一脸老谋深算样的舅舅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以前都有点害怕，怕你会去选军事情报科，陈陈这么阴森森的，成了间谍肯定特别可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚问候用语*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！我是不会讲粗话的。哎，我忍得住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。看你能忍到什么时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有人敲门。稍等！来啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学院信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给陈晖洁小姐的电讯，已经完成了转录，请您检查下终端。为了确保这条信息是您自己阅读的，我需要当面确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西这么大费周章？等我看下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？这......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学院信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看来您已经收到讯息了。学院没有对高保密内容进行例行检查的权力，如果需要对内容进行进一步的咨询，我推荐您直接回件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学院信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还需要我做些什么？没有的话，就此告辞。祝两位度过一个美好的下午。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么要在走廊上走正步啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"你脸色很奇怪。就像你刚收到的信息给了你一拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道该怎么形容自己的心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们知道我朋友的行踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是好事吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"得到她的踪迹这件事......也是她又一次失踪的开始。她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她......杀了当时掳走她的那个人。在这之后又一次......下落不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"那最少——最少她还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......毕业后我会立刻回龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不是......不是，她不是在乌萨斯吗？我以为你一定要去乌萨斯了，还在想要不要毕业前帮你织几条围巾做饯别礼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我在乌萨斯不可能伸得开手脚，但在龙门，我会逐渐扩大自己的优势。龙门的力量在城市间肯定比我一个人的力量强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会找到她的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“泪锋之招，当断即断。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","aliases":["风笛"]}]}
